{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "title": "Ramsey Atlas",
  "checkedDate": "2026-09-26",
  "surveyDate": "2026-04-24",
  "scope": "Curated classical clique Ramsey numbers: all 3 <= s <= t <= 10, R(3,t) through t=15, and selected multicolour cases with 3–9 colours.",
  "intervalConvention": "Inclusive integer endpoints: lower <= R <= upper. A lower-bound witness has lower - 1 vertices.",
  "methodology": [
    "The baseline is Small Ramsey Numbers revision 18 (24 April 2026). Literature searches through 26 September 2026 found no later improvement for the included finite cases. This is not an exhaustive or continuously updated database.",
    "Two-colour upper bounds use Table Ib where it improves Table Ia. Many are unpublished computations reported in the published survey; status is shown per endpoint.",
    "Preprints and survey-listed personal communications are retained with explicit evidence labels. Bounds are not all backed by separately peer-reviewed proof articles.",
    "Bounds for arbitrary parameters are not inferred or presented as best known. Hypergraph, directed, size, induced, and non-clique Ramsey variants are outside scope."
  ],
